      "guidance": "Anthropic describes Claude Opus 5.5 for long-running agentic coding and knowledge work and advises starting with it for most workloads when unsure. It calls the model particularly good at long, sprawling jobs such as codebase-wide migrations and audits. Medium is its default effort.",
